 "description": "Patterned after a Rallye du Maroc / Dakar mountain-and-sand day: rocky Kaokoveld tracks from Sanitatas, a 30 km/h zone through Orupembe settlement, then off-piste north up Hartmann's Valley (grass plains, red sand; the 4x4 track is not routable in OSM so the valley is a navigation section) and a final dune leg towards the Kunene. Realistic: villages as speed zones, WPS before the steep rocky descent, masked waypoints on long tracks, a final navigation leg with no track.",
